	<section_number>15.2-1112</section_number>
	<catch_line>Aid to military units</catch_line>
	<text>
		A municipal corporation may grant financial aid to military units organized in the municipal corporation pursuant to the laws of the Commonwealth.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 15-77.26; 1958, c. 328; 1962, c. 623, § 15.1-862; 1970, c. 225; 1997, c. 587.</history>
